Gump for Debian
===============

Copyright (C) 2026 Alexander R. Croft
Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. A commercial license is available at
https://frogfish.io.

This package is intentionally inert. It installs /usr/bin/gump, documentation,
and an inactive bootstrap unit template under /usr/share/gump/systemd. It does
not create users, directories, configuration, secrets, sockets, or active
services, and it does not start Gump.

Captain is responsible for configuring the host and installing Gump as a
service with the cluster-specific identity, credentials, limits, and bootstrap
parameters.
